---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Studio — SlushTec"
  description="About SlushTec: indie game studio in Tucson / Casas Adobes building adult interactive worlds with permanent consequences."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-6">Studio</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        SlushTec is an indie game studio based in Tucson / Casas Adobes, Arizona.
        We build adult interactive worlds where free-form action writes durable state,
        relationships are bidirectional, and the world keeps score.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our flagship systems are the <strong class="text-white">VARP</strong> engine
        (Virtual Action Role Play) and the <strong class="text-white">True Emotion Engine</strong> —
        designed so NPCs form bias and residue the way people do, not as forgetful chat partners.
      </p>
      <p>
        The studio name and domain were locked in 2026. We value permanent residual,
        local-first ownership of player data, and competence over soft systems.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-surface">
        Founded by Brian “Slush” Slusher. Previous working name Sonoran Forge was retired
        due to a local business name collision.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
